### ==========================================
### 🎟️ PUBLIC / GENERAL READ ROUTES (Any Auth User)
### ==========================================

### 1. Get All Ticket Types for an Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}


### 2. Check Ticket Type Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/availability?quantity=2
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 3. Count Total Ticket Types by Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}/count
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 4. Get Ticket Type with Event Relation
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/with-event
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 5. Get Total Remaining tickettypes by Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}/remaining
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 6. Get Available Ticket Types Only (Open & Un-sold-out)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}/available
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 7. Check if Ticket Type is Sold Out
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/sold-out
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 8. Get Ticket Types by Price Range
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}/price-range?minPrice=500&maxPrice=5000
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 9. Validate Ticket Type Belongs to Event
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/validate-belonging?eventId={{eventId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 10. Get Ticket Type by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}


### ==========================================
### 🔒 ADMIN & ORGANIZER MANAGEMENT ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 11. Create a Single Ticket Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": {{eventId}},
  "name": "VIP Early Bird  1",
  "price": "1.00",
  "quantity": 150,
  "sold": 0
}

### 12. Bulk Create Ticket Types for an Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/bulk
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventId": {{eventId}},
  "ticketTypes": [
    {
      "name": "Regular Advance",
      "price": "1000.00",
      "quantity": 500,
      "sold": 0
    },
    {
      "name": "VVIP Backstage",
      "price": "10000.00",
      "quantity": 30,
      "sold": 0
    }
  ]
}

### 13. Clone Ticket Types to a New Event
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/clone
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceEventId": {{sourceEventId}},
  "targetEventId": {{targetEventId}}
}

### 14. Update Ticket Type Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "VIP Advanced Ticket",
  "price": "3000.00"
}

### 15. Update Ticket Type Capacity
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/capacity
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 200
}

### 16. Update Ticket Type Price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/price
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": "3500.00"
}

### 17. Delete Ticket Type
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 18. Delete All Ticket Types for an Event
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}


### ==========================================
### 📈 ANALYTICS & INVENTORY SUMMARY ROUTES
### ==========================================

### 19. Calculate Revenue Generated by a Specific Ticket Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/revenue
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 20. Get Total Cumulative Event Ticket Revenue
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/1/revenue
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 21. Get Comprehensive Event Inventory Summary Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/event/{{eventId}}/inventory-summary
Cookie: token={{token}}


### ==========================================
### ⚡ INTERNAL SYSTEM MUTATION HOOKS
### ==========================================

### 22. Increment tickettypes Sold Count (Triggered upon sale)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/increment-sold
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 100
}

### 23. Decrement tickettypes Sold Count (Triggered upon refund/cancellation)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/decrement-sold
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "count": 1
}

### 24. Reset tickettypes Sold Count Back to Zero (Admin Only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickettypes/{{ticketTypeId}}/reset-sold
Cookie: token={{token}}